<title>PORTUGAL: Cement sales up 23.5 pct Apr - Bank/Portugal.</title>
<headline>Cement sales up 23.5 pct Apr - Bank/Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese cement sales grew by 23.5 percent in April and by an accumulated 22.9 percent in the first four months of 1997, the Bank of Portugal said in a monthly report.</p>
<p>The cement sales grew by an accumulated 22.6 percent in the first three months of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
